      "content": "7.1 Police Hierarchy in Karnataka"
    },
    {
      "type": "keyFacts",
      "title": "Key Takeaways",
      "items": [
        "Covers the organizational hierarchy, police ranges, and commissionerates across Karnataka.",
        "Details specialized police units functioning within the Karnataka State Police.",
        "Examines the statutory provisions under the Karnataka Police Act, 1963.",
        "Outlines structural transitions from IPC to Bharatiya Nyaya Sanhita (BNS) 2023.",
        "Highlights key procedural shifts from CrPC to Bharatiya Nagarik Suraksha Sanhita (BNSS) 2023."
      ],
      "id": "xne1t7r"
