      "type": "examAlert",
      "items": [
        "Karnataka Police Act was enacted in 1963.",
        "Bharatiya Nyaya Sanhita (BNS) 2023 replaces the Indian Penal Code (IPC).",
        "Bharatiya Nagarik Suraksha Sanhita (BNSS) 2023 replaces the Code of Criminal Procedure (CrPC)."
      ],
      "id": "bg61mt9"
    },
